## {% if is_ubuntu %}Debian{% else %}RPM{% endif %} Packages

What follows next in this Appendix is a series of tables that summarize the
underlying {% if is_ubuntu %}Debian{% else %}RPM{% endif %} packages available
in this OpenHPC release. These packages are organized by groupings based on
their general functionality and each table provides information for the
specific package name, version, brief summary, and the web URL where additional
information can be obtained for the component. Note that many of the 3rd party
community libraries that are pre-packaged with
OpenHPC are built using multiple compiler and MPI families. In these cases, the
package name includes delimiters identifying the development environment for
which each package build is targeted. Additional information on the OpenHPC
package naming scheme is presented in Section 3rd Party Packages. The relevant
package groupings and associated references are as follows:

* Administrative Tools
